-- forward: 1111111011 ==> 1111111111
? tm [If Zr (S (S (S O))), Right, Goto O, Write On] [On, On, On, On, On, On, On, Zr, On, On] res
-- backward: which inputs give 111? (3 answers; then the search diverges on inputs without a '0')
? tm [If Zr (S (S (S O))), Right, Goto O, Write On] right [On, On, On]
-- partially known input
? tm [If Zr (S (S (S O))), Right, Goto O, Write On] [x, y, z, On] res
